"Dji scrî l' copeye di såvrité del båze di dnêyes da Nepomuk dins <filename>"
"%1</filename>..."

#: backupwizardpages.cpp:111
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Backup of the Nepomuk database successfully written to <filename>%1</"
"filename>."
