#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label)
#: intropage.ui:44
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Create a backup of the current Nepomuk database including all manually "
"created data. This backup can later be restored by choosing the "
"<interface>Restore</interface> option below."
msgstr ""
"Ahivez ene copeye di såvrité del båze di dnêyes da Nepomuk do moumint tot "
"metant dvins totes les dnêyes ahivêyes al mwin. On sait rapexhî cisse copeye "
"di såvrité cial tot tchoezixhant l' tchuze <interface>Rapexhî</interface> "
"cial pa dzo."

#. i18n: ectx: property (text), widget (QLabel, label_2)
#: intropage.ui:120
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Restore an automated Nepomuk system backup or a manual backup created with "
"the <interface>Backup</interface> tool above."
msgstr ""
"Rapexhîz ene copeye di såvrité sistinme da Nepomuk fwaite otomaticmint oudon-"
"bén ene copeye di såvrité fwaite al mwin ahivêye avou l' usteye "
"<interface>Copeye di såvrité</interface> cial pa dzeu."

